Louis Maller was an agent of [[Org/Concordia/index|Concordia]], the other of the two sent after [[Phenomena/Keystone|keystone 14]], partner to [[Org/Concordia/People/Crawford Reeves|Crawford Reeves]]. He fought with blasts of sound, one loud enough to leave [[People/Sir Arctos|Arctos]] and [[People/Benny|Benny]] unable to hear.

He is dead, killed at the [[Geography/Calaria/Hallia/Sableclutch/Prime Meridian Sub Transit Nexus|Sub Transit Nexus]] by [[People/Benny|Benny]], who ran him through from behind while a laughing fit from [[People/Johnny|Johnny]] held him.

He carried no identification. His boots had heels set on actuators that can be detached and fixed to another pair of shoes; the clockwork heels add a spring to the wearer's step. [[People/Benny|Benny]] now wears them on his own shoes.
